## Summary

Create an OpenAI-compatible tools wrapper for memory operations, similar to supermemory's `@supermemory/tools` package, enabling easy integration with AI SDK and OpenAI function calling.

## Background

Supermemory provides `@supermemory/tools` package that exports ready-to-use OpenAI function tools:

```typescript
export function supermemoryTools(apiKey, config) {
  return {
    searchMemories: searchMemoriesTool(apiKey, config),
    addMemory: addMemoryTool(apiKey, config),
  }
}
`

